---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 2026 Challenge Intake
description: "Review the 2026 challenge, then sign it using the secure form directly below the document."
permalink: /2026-challenge-intake/index.html
ogType: website
---
{% set challengePdfPath = "/documents/2026-challenge.pdf" %}
{# Add the final PDF at static/documents/2026-challenge.pdf. Eleventy publishes it at the challengePdfPath above. #}
{# To change the reader to a different challenge PDF, place it in static/documents/ and update challengePdfPath above. #}
<div data-pagefind-body>
  <section aria-labelledby="challenge-intake-heading" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-8">
    {% set sectionKicker = "2026" %}{% set sectionTitle = "Challenge Intake" %}{% set sectionId = "challenge-intake-heading" %}{% set sectionLevel = "h1" %}
    {% include "components/section-header.njk" %}

    <article class="card prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h2>Review the challenge, then sign below</h2>
      <p class="text-xl">
        Read the 2026 challenge in the document viewer. When you are ready, scroll to the signature form directly below the challenge to add your signature and submit your intake information.
      </p>
      <aside class="rounded-xl border-2 border-accent bg-surface-overlay p-4" aria-label="Signature eligibility">
        <p class="m-0"><strong>Eligibility:</strong> Only West Virginia Democrats in good standing may sign this challenge.</p>
      </aside>
      <p>
        If the document reader does not load, you can
        <a href="{{ challengePdfPath }}">open the challenge PDF directly</a>.
      </p>
    </article>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="challenge-pdf-heading">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 id="challenge-pdf-heading">1. Review the challenge</h2>
      </div>
      <div
        class="mt-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900"
        data-pdf-reader
        data-pdf-url="{{ challengePdfPath }}"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-950">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-sm disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 dark:border-slate-600" type="button" data-pdf-previous disabled>Previous</button>
            <button class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-sm disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 dark:border-slate-600" type="button" data-pdf-next disabled>Next</button>
          </div>
          <p class="m-0 font-mono text-sm" data-pdf-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading challenge PDF…</p>
          <a class="font-mono text-sm" href="{{ challengePdfPath }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open PDF</a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex min-h-[620px] items-start justify-center overflow-auto p-3 sm:p-6" data-pdf-stage>
          <canvas class="max-w-full bg-white shadow-lg" data-pdf-canvas role="img" aria-label="Loading the challenge PDF"></canvas>
          <noscript>
            <p class="max-w-xl self-center text-center">
              JavaScript is required for the embedded reader.
              <a href="{{ challengePdfPath }}">Open the challenge PDF directly</a>.
            </p>
          </noscript>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="signature-heading">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 id="signature-heading">2. Sign the challenge</h2>
        <p>Use the secure Adobe form below to add your signature and submit your intake information.</p>
        <p><strong>Only West Virginia Democrats in good standing may sign.</strong></p>
        <p>
          If the form does not load, you can
          <a href="https://na3.documents.adobe.com/public/esignWidget?wid=CBFCIBAA3AAABLblqZhBI0WkAEG2sc2NOB7GWXtoMEqWaZCIHQ5uJpESXOtF4btS2YEVwb7ELIUo48PrAQvM*&amp;hosted=false" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open the secure signature form in a new tab</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-950" style="height: min(90vh, 900px); min-height: 560px;">
        <iframe src="https://na3.documents.adobe.com/public/esignWidget?wid=CBFCIBAA3AAABLblqZhBI0WkAEG2sc2NOB7GWXtoMEqWaZCIHQ5uJpESXOtF4btS2YEVwb7ELIUo48PrAQvM*&amp;hosted=false" width="100%" height="100%" title="Adobe signature intake form" loading="lazy" style="border: 0; display: block; min-height: 560px;"></iframe>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</div>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/challenge-pdf-reader.js"></script>
